  "final_message": "`shipping.ZONES` in `shipping.py` has 5 distinct keys: `NA-EAST`, `NA-WEST`, `EU-CENTRAL`, `EU-NORTH` and `APAC-SE`. Loading the module and taking `len(shipping.ZONES)` also returns 5.\n\nNone of the other files change the count:\n- **`decoy_legacy_zones.py`** is an old table of zones that are no longer used.\n- **`decoy_partner_regions.py`** lists a partner carrier's regions, not zone codes.\n- **`decoy_warehouse_map.py`** maps warehouses to zones. Its values are codes already in `ZONES`, so it adds none.\n- **`checkout.py`, `notify.py` and `.amplifier/settings.local.yaml`** contain no zone definitions.\n\nANSWER: 5",
